      "level": 2,
      "content": "6. Orthographic Views"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "pn83l6d",
      "content": "Orthographic views are used to represent three-dimensional objects using two-dimensional drawings. Each view shows the object from a specific direction."
    },
    {
